  "Comment": {
    "type": "cexostring",
    "value": "Sowing Discord in Bree response spawn (roadmap: sowing-discord-bree): the law that arrives QSOW_SHERIFF_DELAY seconds after the third forged letter is planted (q_sow_inc QSOW_SheriffArrives, CreateObject at the last table's location -- never hand-placed). Clone of the existing Guardian of Bree (breelocal001) raised to fighter 16 / CR 16 for the T2 L15+ quest; conversation removed; keeps faction Defender and attacks only the planter via SetIsTemporaryEnemy + ActionAttack, so the taproom does not erupt into a faction war. Spawns alongside one regular breelocal001 deputy."
